            "review_title": "Review at Whale Napoli Pizza Nha Trang",
            "review_text": "Will\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam14 contributions\n0\nThe best authentic pizza in Nha Trang\nJun 2025 • Solo\nThe most authentic Italian style pizza I’ve found in Nha Trang. Available in three sizes and in many authentic varieties, this is the go to place for pizza in Nha Trang. The place is tiny, with only three outdoor tables out front, under a canopy, but a great place to relax and watch the world go by. This is a family run business in a quiet residential street. Great ambience, great location, fantastic food, friendly and efficient staff. Highly recommended!!\nRead more\nWritten June 3, 2025",
